"""Tool map, tools. Curated by hand from the sources linked in each entry (read 2026-10-14). Versions, release dates,
last commits, licences and the archived flag are NOT typed here: gen_data.py fills them from inputs/ (PyPI JSON API,
GitHub REST API and Atom feeds, Hugging Face API), so every dated cell has one machine-read source.
Fields: layer (pipeline, extract, lid, quality, dedup, pii, framework, storage), repo (GitHub, for push/commit/archived),
pypi (package for version and date), hf (model id), lc (licence class: permissive, share-alike, noncommercial, custom,
none), status (active, maintained, quiet, archived, superseded), used (corpus ids from atlas_corpora.py that cite it),
verdict (a judgement, labelled as such on the page), src (sources read)."""
